            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is the best pick if you have any issues with survivability whatsoever at this point.\n\nIf the enemy team isn't putting any pressure on you at all, getting [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) first is probably the optimal pick, but Soldier is often a target for burst damage that will take you down quickly like missile dives from Diva or aimed shots from Freya. [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is often enough to help you survive those targeted attacks at this point and stay in the fight longer, while also giving you some extra damage output.\n\nIf sticking with your team means you're getting hit by a lot of incidental effects (burns from Ashe's dynamite, chained sleeps from Ana, Junker Queen's Rampage ult, etc.), consider picking up a [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f). It's reasonably cheap, and 40% reduced negative effect duration is huge \u2013 for burns, it's 40% less damage, and it makes it much easier to keep yourself alive and topped up with biotic field. It also means if there's an enemy Ashe burning you, she'll be doing less damage, getting less money, and is less likely to snowball into a powerhouse.",
