            "notes": "If you're up against a Junker Queen, or a Reinhardt or Sigma that isn't building up their barriers much, pick up [Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371) as your final power. It'll help you keep putting out as much damage as possible.\n\nIf you're up against a sturdier tank, or fighting heroes like Zarya or Genji where you might need to be more careful about when you're firing, go [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) instead.\n\nIf you didn't already pick up [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b), now's the time. If it's still out of your price range, or the enemy has a lot of attack speed boosts, then [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) can be a good alternative.\n\nIf you're flush with cash *and* confident in your discipline to always have shots in reserve when you proc [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9), then you can drop Pulse Converter for something with more output; but in most situations, I think it's worth keeping.",
